---
import { BOOKING_URL, SPECDR_URL } from '../data/links';
---

<section id="services" aria-labelledby="services-title" class="services">
  <div class="intro">
    <h2 id="services-title">Have a product? Let's make it better.</h2>
    <p>I start from what you have. Early-stage, growth or enterprise, the work happens inside your product and alongside your team, so they can keep running it after I'm gone.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="offers">
    <div class="offer" style="border-top-color: var(--lilac)">
      <h3>Proof Sprint</h3>
      <p>One week inside your product: prove the problem, then put a working solution in front of the customers who raised it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="offer" style="border-top-color: var(--amber)">
      <h3>AI Product Foundations</h3>
      <p>The evals, retrieval and data layer your existing product needs to ship AI features that hold up.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="offer offer-gradient">
      <h3>Fractional AI PM</h3>
      <p>A player-coach on your team, running the loop on your product and teaching your team to run it without me.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="cred">Founding PM at Atomic, where we raised an $800K pre-seed. Principal PM for the data and AI platform at G-P. Advised three early-stage AI startups; two raised over $3M.</p>
  <div class="cta">
    <a href={BOOKING_URL} data-booking class="btn btn-molten book">Book an AI Readiness Chat</a>
    <span class="aside">Moving a whole engineering org to spec-driven delivery? That's <a href={SPECDR_URL}>Specdr</a>.</span>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .services {
    max-width: var(--max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 112px 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 48px;
  }
  .intro {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 24px 72px;
    align-items: flex-end;
  }
  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    flex: 999 1 520px;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 68px);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }
  .intro p {
    margin: 0;
    flex: 1 1 320px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .offers {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 40px;
  }
  .offer {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 4px solid;
  }
  .offer-gradient {
    border-image: linear-gradient(90deg, #7AA2FF, #B8AAFF, #FFB347, #FF6A3D) 1;
  }
  h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 26px;
  }
  .offer p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .cred {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 72ch;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px 32px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .book {
    padding: 16px 28px;
    min-height: 54px;
  }
  .aside {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
